gency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":172594,"global_rank":419160},{"name":"TheHeidal/placeoverlay","owner":"TheHeidal","html_url":"https://github.com/TheHeidal/placeoverlay","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":172594,"global_rank":419161},{"name":"mbmcc/PPP","owner":"mbmcc","html_url":"https://github.com/mbmcc/PPP","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":172594,"global_rank":419162}]